# Auto-detect text files and normalize their line endings to LF, both in the
# repo and on checkout, on every platform. This project is edited from both
# Windows and the Linux side of a device bridge; without a forced eol, files
# ping-pong between CRLF and LF and a real one-line change shows up as a
# whole-file diff where every line is removed and re-added identically.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary types — never run through text normalization
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
